{"input_path": "input/ipas中級_科目2_大數據處理分析與應用_imgs/page_0046.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 2382, "height": 3368, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header", "block_content": "第三章 機率統計基礎", "block_bbox": [1559, 207, 2080, 260], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1559.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 260.0], [1559.0, 260.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "◆ 假設設定", "block_bbox": [477, 402, 753, 463], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[477.0, 402.0], [753.0, 402.0], [753.0, 463.0], [477.0, 463.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 比較兩組樣本的比例  $ p_{1} $ 與  $ p_{2} $ 是否有顯著差異。", "block_bbox": [534, 502, 1698, 563], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 502.0], [1698.0, 502.0], [1698.0, 563.0], [534.0, 563.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 虛無假設（H₀）： $ p_1 = p_2 $（兩組比例無差異）。", "block_bbox": [535, 602, 1627, 664], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 602.0], [1627.0, 602.0], [1627.0, 664.0], [535.0, 664.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 對立假設（H $ _{1} $）依檢定方向分為三種形式：", "block_bbox": [536, 701, 1553, 763], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[536.0, 701.0], [1553.0, 701.0], [1553.0, 763.0], [536.0, 763.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>檢定類型</td><td>對立假設  $ H_{1} $</td><td>適用情境</td></tr><tr><td>雙尾檢定</td><td>$ p_{1} = p_{2} $</td><td>關注兩組之間是否存在任何差異</td></tr><tr><td>左尾檢定</td><td>$ p_{1} < p_{2} $</td><td>關注第一組比例是否顯著低於第二組</td></tr><tr><td>右尾檢定</td><td>$ p_{1} > p_{2} $</td><td>關注第一組比例是否顯著高於第二組</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [307, 796, 2073, 1149], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[307.0, 796.0], [2073.0, 796.0], [2073.0, 1149.0], [307.0, 1149.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "常見誤用與注意事項", "block_bbox": [473, 1224, 1007, 1286], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[473.0, 1224.0], [1007.0, 1224.0], [1007.0, 1286.0], [473.0, 1286.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 資料非二元類別時不應使用本檢定（例如 Likert 尺度應使用其他方法）。", "block_bbox": [508, 1328, 2079, 1490], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[508.0, 1328.0], [2079.0, 1328.0], [2079.0, 1490.0], [508.0, 1490.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "樣本依賴性未剔除：若樣本間有對應關係（如前後測），應使用成對比例檢定而非此法。", "block_bbox": [528, 1523, 2078, 1687], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[528.0, 1523.0], [2078.0, 1523.0], [2078.0, 1687.0], [528.0, 1687.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "忽略樣本基數不均：當兩組樣本數極不相等時，推論時需格外小心。", "block_bbox": [529, 1727, 2079, 1789], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[529.0, 1727.0], [2079.0, 1727.0], [2079.0, 1789.0], [529.0, 1789.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 樣本事件數太少：若任一組成功或失敗事件太少，常態近似不成立，建議使用精確檢定（如 Fisher's exact test）。", "block_bbox": [528, 1825, 2076, 1989], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[528.0, 1825.0], [2076.0, 1825.0], [2076.0, 1989.0], [528.0, 1989.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 不清楚所比較的「事件定義」是否一致：應明確定義何為「成功」或「事件」以避免解釋誤差。", "block_bbox": [533, 2026, 2080, 2186], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 2026.0], [2080.0, 2026.0], [2080.0, 2186.0], [533.0, 2186.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "卡方檢定（Chi-square test）", "block_bbox": [404, 2225, 1066, 2286], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[404.0, 2225.0], [1066.0, 2225.0], [1066.0, 2286.0], [404.0, 2286.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "◆ 方法概述", "block_bbox": [477, 2326, 752, 2385], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[477.0, 2326.0], [752.0, 2326.0], [752.0, 2385.0], [477.0, 2385.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "卡方檢定是一種常見的非參數檢定方法，用於分析類別資料是否呈現某種統計關係。依據目的不同，可分為兩種主要形式：", "block_bbox": [535, 2428, 2078, 2589], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 2428.0], [2078.0, 2428.0], [2078.0, 2589.0], [535.0, 2589.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "獨立性檢定（Test of Independence）：用於判斷兩個類別變數是否彼此相關。常用於交叉表分析，例如檢查性別與投票傾向是否有關聯。", "block_bbox": [588, 2626, 2080, 2888], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[588.0, 2626.0], [2080.0, 2626.0], [2080.0, 2888.0], [588.0, 2888.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "適合度檢定（Goodness-of-Fit Test）：用於檢驗觀察資料是否與預期分佈吻合，例如檢查擲骰子的結果是否為公平分佈。", "block_bbox": [590, 2927, 2081, 3089], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[590.0, 2927.0], [2081.0, 2927.0], [2081.0, 3089.0], [590.0, 3089.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "3-39", "block_bbox": [2101, 3189, 2197, 3231], "block_id": 17, "block_order": null, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[2101.0, 3189.0], [2197.0, 3189.0], [2197.0, 3231.0], [2101.0, 3231.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 12, "label": "header", "score": 0.8737476468086243, "coordinate": [1559, 207, 2080, 260], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1559.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 260.0], [1559.0, 260.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6303615570068359, "coordinate": [477, 402, 753, 463], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[477.0, 402.0], [753.0, 402.0], [753.0, 463.0], [477.0, 463.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8620653748512268, "coordinate": [534, 502, 1698, 563], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 502.0], [1698.0, 502.0], [1698.0, 563.0], [534.0, 563.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.6367031931877136, "coordinate": [1074, 513, 1128, 561], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[1074.0, 513.0], [1128.0, 513.0], [1128.0, 561.0], [1074.0, 561.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.37785717844963074, "coordinate": [1221, 509, 1355, 560], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[1221.0, 509.0], [1355.0, 509.0], [1355.0, 560.0], [1221.0, 560.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8569386005401611, "coordinate": [535, 602, 1627, 664], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[535.0, 602.0], [1627.0, 602.0], [1627.0, 664.0], [535.0, 664.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.5684078335762024, "coordinate": [970, 611, 1156, 661], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[970.0, 611.0], [1156.0, 611.0], [1156.0, 661.0], [970.0, 661.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8452856540679932, "coordinate": [536, 701, 1553, 763], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[536.0, 701.0], [1553.0, 701.0], [1553.0, 763.0], [536.0, 763.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9651235938072205, "coordinate": [307, 796, 2073, 1149], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[307.0, 796.0], [2073.0, 796.0], [2073.0, 1149.0], [307.0, 1149.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.435409277677536, "coordinate": [1064, 821, 1123, 870], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[1064.0, 821.0], [1123.0, 821.0], [1123.0, 870.0], [1064.0, 870.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.5759101510047913, "coordinate": [901, 915, 1084, 967], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[901.0, 915.0], [1084.0, 915.0], [1084.0, 967.0], [901.0, 967.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.31296220421791077, "coordinate": [900, 1088, 954, 1142], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[900.0, 1088.0]